[53.634368, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.001102ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[53.634739, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.827837ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.555252ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.260682ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.350095ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[53.634959, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(1.809643ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(0.578463ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(0.933618ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
