[87.459222, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ parses a signature header with two v1 entries \u001b[90m(1.240626ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[87.461609, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ accepts a correctly signed body \u001b[90m(0.944524ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a body signed with the wrong secret \u001b[90m(0.722122ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ rejects a stale timestamp \u001b[90m(0.523164ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ policy: small INR refunds auto-approve, others go to review \u001b[90m(0.225263ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ cancelling a pending refund \u001b[90m(2.537831ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ a redelivered event creates only one refund \u001b[90m(0.808507ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[87.462215, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ authz: keys map to role permissions \u001b[90m(1.28879ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
